<title>CHINA: China's Jan-Feb coal imports slide 39.6 pct.</title>
<headline>China's Jan-Feb coal imports slide 39.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 250,000 tonnes of coal in the first two months of 1997, down 39.6 percent from the same period last year, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Imports in February alone were 70,000 tonnes, the figures showed.</p>
<p>China's coal exports were 4.14 million tonnes in January and February, up 72.5 percent from the first two months of last year, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Exports in February were 2.36 million tonnes, the figures showed.</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
